        "command": "/bin/bash -lc 'for f in /AGENTS.md /home/AGENTS.md /home/sandbox/AGENTS.md /home/sandbox/workspace/AGENTS.md /home/sandbox/workspace/integrations/AGENTS.md /home/sandbox/workspace/integrations/hubspot/AGENTS.md; do if [ -f \"$f\" ]; then printf '\"'\\\\n%s\\\\n' \\\"\"'$f\"; cat \"$f\"; fi; done'"
